    "description": "<p>The dataset covers the research data of the publication in ChemElectroChem with the title \"Nickel and Commercially Available Nickel-Containing Alloys as Electrodes for the Electrochemical Oxygen Evolution\" (<span>DOI: 10.1002/celc.202300460</span>). The provided data comprehend the main experimental data obtained in the electrochemical studies.</p>",
